# Generated large text telemetry is preserved in per-revision archives.
**/trials/*.json
!**/trials/*-summary.json
**/trials/*.sdf
**/trials/*.log
**/meshes/*.stl
# Lossless inputs.zip keeps repeated generated numeric arrays out of diffs.
**/geometry.json
**/model.json
**/stance-search.json
# v25 used incorrect hip case/horn ownership. Keep only archived evidence.
v25/*
!v25/README.md
!v25/superseded.zip
!v25/superseded.sha256
